{"id":954626,"title":"14｜MCP协议：标准化定义工具接口","content":"<p>欢迎回来！这节课我们将进入一个绝对重磅的议题——<strong>MCP（Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议）</strong>。</p>\n<p>说实话，MCP 这个话题非常硬核，甚至足够单开一门课来专门讲解。在前面的课程中，我们学习了如何自己手写 Python 代码来封装各种本地工具。但在真实的工业界，如果我们每一次接入新系统都要从零手写一堆业务逻辑代码，这显然违背了软件工程的效率原则。</p>\n<p>2024 年，Claude 的母公司 Anthropic 提出了一套革命性的协议——MCP。它的出现，正在彻底改变 AI Agent 与外部世界交互的方式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>一、 认知原点：什么是 MCP 协议？</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/cc/b4/ccdd5eff810f4b3a653c2d161c235db4.png?wh=2278x1106\" alt=\"图片\"><br>\n首先要明确一个核心概念：<strong>MCP 本质上是一个“协议”（Protocol），而不是一个具体的软件或开源项目</strong>。你可以把它类比为互联网世界的 HTTP 协议。只要大家都遵循同一套标准来“说话”，不同的系统之间就能无缝沟通。</p>\n<p>MCP 协议将整个 AI 工具调用的链路极其优雅地拆分成了两端：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>MCP Client（客户端）</strong>：也就是我们的 Agent 或者 AI 应用。它负责理解用户的自然语言，进行推理决策。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>MCP Server（服务端）</strong>：也就是提供底层工具和数据源的地方（例如你的企业邮箱系统、内部数据库、甚至是一套完整的 OA 系统）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406529,"user_name":"Waylon","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1310297,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"D9269A5A42F670","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eoUEZtvgjx3Lo8ib1GxBruDJCLXxX0KfRptk7BoBtRebKMA4Chp2tPbiaCwlCQ9hBZ4JnukX1bs9blA/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775155879,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151104,"content":"可以啊，不过其实框架还是其次，企业里mcp最重要的是怎么做企业级的鉴权，身份认证和安全管理","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1775181079,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406529,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"去年选择了FastMCP 框架构建了企业的内部某个系统的MCP Server. FastMCP 有自己的运行时（mcp.run()），可以直接启动 MCP 服务器。老师有关注过，或者推荐吗？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":683081,"discussion_content":"可以啊，不过其实框架还是其次，企业里mcp最重要的是怎么做企业级的鉴权，身份认证和安全管理","content_length":129,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1775181079,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406362,"user_name":"D，max","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2994355,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"0530938F69933F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2d/b0/b3/acee0699.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1774771850,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151084,"content":"不是的，mcp是外部服务，可以理解是webservice，有标准的接口文档给agent用","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1774963710,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406362,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"那我理解mcp 就像前端的 npm 仓库，用户可以发布到 npm，被其他人下载，下载也是一次性都下载下来很多组件，真正想用的可能就那几个。但前端可以构建时过滤，这个是运行时，需要运行时过滤","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682964,"discussion_content":"不是的，mcp是外部服务，可以理解是webservice，有标准的接口文档给agent用","content_length":96,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1774963710,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":407898,"user_name":"树","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1045646,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"8080E671F84C46","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/f4/8e/081c530c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1779779019,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"课程很棒。之前学过一些mcp server 的搭建防范，以为加个API key 就可以拿到真实环境中使用了。\n这么看来，课程很好地补上了企业MCP server落地的最后一公里。","like_count":0}]}